  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To deliver skill-based trainings to around 330,000 poor and vulnerable people in the Punjab district ( of which 40% are women) with an aim to provide a pool of skilled workers for the private sector firms, leading to enhanced incomes and employment prospects and encouraging private sector training providers to build up their training capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
